#. type: YAML Front Matter: title
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "Custom ASCII-art startup banners for Quarkus"
msgstr "Quarkus 的自定义 ASCII 艺术启动横幅"

#. type: YAML Front Matter: synopsis
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "A tiny extension that renders your application name as a bold startup banner, so you always know which service just scrolled past in the logs."
msgstr "一个微型扩展程序，可将您的应用名称以粗体启动横幅的形式显示出来，这样您就能随时知道日志中刚刚滚动而过的究竟是哪项服务。"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You know the feeling. Three terminals open, a dozen services, and a wall of logs scrolling past. Which one just\n"
"restarted? Was that _orders_ or _order-history_? You scroll back up, squint, and hunt for the line that tells\n"
"you."
msgstr "你一定有过这种感觉：同时打开三个终端，运行着十几个服务，日志像墙一样不断滚动。哪个服务刚刚重启了？那是 _订单_ 还是 _订单历史_ ？你向上滚动屏幕，眯起眼睛，寻找能告诉你答案的那一行。"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Quarkus already prints a banner at start-up -- but it is the *same* banner for every application. So I built a\n"
"small Quarkiverse extension that fixes that: *Quarkus Banner* turns your application name into a big, unmissable\n"
"piece of ASCII art."
msgstr "Quarkus 在启动时会显示一条横幅——但所有应用程序显示的 *都是同一条* 横幅。因此，我开发了一个小型 Quarkiverse 扩展程序来解决这个问题： *Quarkus Banner* 能将您的应用程序名称转换成一幅醒目且引人注目的 ASCII 艺术图。"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now when that service scrolls past, you know exactly what you are looking at -- no squinting required."
msgstr "现在，当那个服务列表滚动经过时，你一眼就能看清内容——无需眯起眼睛。"

#. type: Title =
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "Try it in 30 seconds"
msgstr "30秒内试一试"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "Add the extension:"
msgstr "添加扩展名："

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Start your app. That is it -- you already have a banner built from your application name. Want to make it your\n"
"own? Pick some text with `quarkus.banner-generator.text` and a font with `quarkus.banner-generator.font`:"
msgstr "启动你的应用。就这样——系统已经根据你的应用名称生成了一条横幅。想让它更具个性吗？使用 `quarkus.banner-generator.text` 选择一些文本，并使用 `quarkus.banner-generator.font` 选择一种字体："

#. type: Title =
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "246 fonts, one of them is yours"
msgstr "246种字体，其中一种是你的"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is where it gets fun. The extension ships with *246 FIGlet fonts*, so you are never stuck with one look.\n"
"Want something clean and readable? Reach for `standard`, `slant` or `big`. Want to make a statement? `doom`,\n"
"`colossal` and `3d_diagonal` are waiting. There is everything from tidy and corporate to gloriously,\n"
"unapologetically over-the-top -- the same word rendered in `standard`:"
msgstr "接下来就更有趣了。该扩展程序自带 *246 种 FIGlet 字体* ，因此您绝不会被局限于一种样式。 想要简洁易读的字体？试试 `“standard”` 、 `“slant”` 或 `“big”` 。想要彰显个性？ `“doom”` 、 `“colossal` ”和 `“3d_diagonal”` 正等着你。从整洁的商务风格到华丽、毫不掩饰的夸张风格，应有尽有——同一个单词用 `“standard”` 渲染的效果如下："

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "...becomes this in `doom`, just by changing one property:"
msgstr "……​在 `Doom` 中，只需更改一个属性，就会变成这样："

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The full catalogue, with author credits, is in the\n"
"https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-banner/blob/main/FIGLET-FONTS.md[`FIGLET-FONTS.md`] file in the\n"
"repository."
msgstr "完整的目录（含作者署名）位于代码库中的 link:https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-banner/blob/main/FIGLET-FONTS.md[FIGLET-FONTS.md] 文件中。"

#. type: Title =
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "A playground in the Dev UI"
msgstr "Dev UI 中的一个游乐场"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Trawling 246 fonts sounds like a chore -- so it is not one. In dev mode the extension adds a *Quarkus Banner*\n"
"card to the http://localhost:8080/q/dev-ui/[Quarkus Dev UI] with a *Preview* page built for exactly this."
msgstr "翻找246种字体听起来像是一项繁琐的工作——但其实并非如此。在开发模式下，该扩展程序会在 link:http://localhost:8080/q/dev-ui/[Quarkus开发界面] 中添加一张 *Quarkus横幅* 卡片，其中包含一个专门为此设计的 *预览* 页面。"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Type any text, pick any font from the list, toggle the _Powered by Quarkus_ tagline, and the rendered banner\n"
"updates live in front of you -- no restart, no HTTP request, no rebuild. When you find the one, a *Print to log*\n"
"button drops it straight into your application console so you can see it in context. Cycling through fonts until\n"
"one clicks becomes the genuinely fun five minutes it should be."
msgstr "输入任意文本，从列表中选择任意字体， _切换“Powered by Quarkus”_ 标语，渲染后的横幅就会在您眼前实时更新——无需重启、无需 HTTP 请求、无需重新构建。当您找到满意的样式时， *点击“打印到日志* ”按钮即可将其直接发送到应用程序控制台，以便您在上下文中查看效果。 反复试用各种字体，直到找到心仪的那一款，这五分钟的体验将变得真正充满乐趣。"

#. type: Title =
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "The good bits"
msgstr "精彩之处"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The banner is rendered at *build time*, so there is zero runtime cost -- it is baked in, not computed on every\n"
"start-up."
msgstr "该横幅是在 *构建时* 渲染的，因此运行时开销为零——它是预渲染的，不会在每次启动时重新计算。"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It slots in exactly where Quarkus' own banner goes, honouring your console colours and format, and it shows up\n"
"when you run your tests too."
msgstr "它会精准地嵌入到 Quarkus 自身横幅的位置，保留您控制台的配色和格式，并且在您运行测试时也会显示出来。"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Nothing to disable and nothing to break: if you turn it off, or the text will not render, you simply get the\n"
"default Quarkus banner back."
msgstr "无需禁用任何功能，也不会导致任何故障：如果你将其关闭，或者文本无法渲染，系统只会恢复显示默认的 Quarkus 横幅。"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Everything else -- the config options and dev-mode tips -- lives in the\n"
"https://docs.quarkiverse.io/quarkus-banner/dev/[extension documentation]."
msgstr "其他所有内容——配置选项和开发模式提示——都收录在 link:https://docs.quarkiverse.io/quarkus-banner/dev/[扩展程序的文档中] 。"

#. type: Title =
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "Give it a go"
msgstr "试一试吧"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Quarkus Banner is deliberately tiny. It does one thing: it makes your application instantly recognisable, and it\n"
"makes start-up a little more fun."
msgstr "Quarkus Banner 设计得非常小巧。它只有一个作用：让你的应用程序一眼就能被认出来，并让启动过程变得更有趣一些。"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I would love to hear what you think -- which fonts you land on, where it is useful, and especially what you would\n"
"like it to do next. Drop your thoughts, ideas and feature requests on the\n"
"https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-banner[GitHub repository]."
msgstr "我很想听听大家的看法——你们最终选择了哪些字体、在哪些场景下觉得它有用，尤其是希望它接下来能实现哪些功能。请在 link:https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-banner[GitHub 代码库中] 分享你们的想法、建议和功能请求。"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-03-quarkus-banner-extension.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "Happy bannering!"
msgstr "祝制作横幅愉快！"
